> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @chicken breasts{7/20%lb}, @olive oil{2/5%tbsp}, @lime juice{2/5%tbsp}, @garlic cloves{2/5} (minced), @honey{1/5%tbsp}, @cumin{1/5%tsp}, @smoked paprika{1/5%tsp}, @salt{1/5%tsp}, @black pepper{1/10%tsp}, @pineapple{2/5%cup} (diced), @red onion{1/10} (diced), @red bell pepper{1/5} (diced), @jalapeno{1/5} (minced), @cilantro{1/15%cup} (chopped), @lime juice{2/5%tbsp}, @salt{1/20%tsp}, @?dry jasmine rice{3/10%cup}.

== Preparation ==

Season chicken with olive oil, lime, garlic, honey and spices and grill until cooked through. Combine pineapple, onion, pepper, jalapeno, cilantro and remaining lime as salsa. Serve with the chicken and optional cooked rice.
